<title>AUSTRALIA: RTR-Victoria state sells car fleet to CBA.</title>
<headline>RTR-Victoria state sells car fleet to CBA.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Victoria state government said on Wednesday that it had sold its 8,200-strong car fleet to the Commonwealth Bank of Australia for A$190 million under a sale and lease-back agreement.</p>
</text>
